CERT MOONLIGHT CLUB/FANCONCERT MOONLIGHT CLUB DAY2-05 TAEHOON SOLO STAGE.webp\" alt=\"MOONLIGHT CLUB DAY 2 TAEHOON 솔로 스테이지\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>05 · TAEHOON SOLO STAGE</figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\"><img src=\"assets/images/FANCONCERT MOONLIGHT CLUB/FANCONCERT MOONLIGHT CLUB DAY2-06 TAEHOON SOLO STAGE AFTER.webp\" alt=\"MOONLIGHT CLUB DAY 2 TAEHOON 솔로 스테이지 애프터\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>06 · TAEHOON SOLO STAGE AFTER</figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\"><img src=\"assets/images/FANCONCERT MOONLIGHT CLUB/FANCONCERT MOONLIGHT CLUB DAY2-07 TALK1.webp\" alt=\"MOONLIGHT CLUB DAY 2 토크 1\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>07 · TALK 1</figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\"><img src=\"assets/images/FANCONCERT MOONLIGHT CLUB/FANCONCERT MOONLIGHT CLUB DAY2-08 TALK2.webp\" alt=\"MOONLIGHT CLUB DAY 2 토크 2\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>08 · TALK 2</figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\"><img src=\"assets/images/FANCONCERT MOONLIGHT CLUB/FANCONCERT MOONLIGHT CLUB DAY2-09 MENT.webp\" alt=\"MOONLIGHT CLUB DAY 2 멘트\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>09 · MENT</figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\"><img src=\"assets/images/FANCONCERT MOONLIGHT CLUB/FANCONCERT MOONLIGHT CLUB DAY2-10 STAGE2.webp\" alt=\"MOONLIGHT CLUB DAY 2 스테이지 2\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>10 · STAGE 2</figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\"><img src=\"assets/images/FANCONCERT MOONLIGHT CLUB/FANCONCERT MOONLIGHT CLUB DAY2-11 BEFORE ENCORE.webp\" alt=\"MOONLIGHT CLUB DAY 2 앵콜 전\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>11 · BEFORE ENCORE</figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\"><img src=\"assets/images/FANCONCERT MOONLIGHT CLUB/FANCONCERT MOONLIGHT CLUB DAY2-12 ENCORE.webp\" alt=\"MOONLIGHT CLUB DAY 2 앵콜\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>12 · ENCORE</figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery-item reveal\"><img src=\"assets/images/FANCONCERT MOONLIGHT CLUB/FANCONC